  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut tomato and onion (see ingredients) into thick wedges.\n• Place tomato, onion and carrot & zucchini mix on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until almost tender, 15-20 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, roughly tear kale leaves (see ingredients), then discard the stems.\n• When the veggies are almost tender, add kale and a pinch of salt to the tray. Gently toss to combine. Roast until tender, a further 5-8 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6671474cbc5e6cd914c30b3d-e5819d5c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and salt. Bring to the boil, then simmer, uncovered, until couscous is tender and water is absorbed, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6671474cbc5e6cd914c30b3d-3ab7a864.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop parsley.\n• In a small bowl, add a generous drizzle of oil from the marinated goat cheese. Add the balsamic vinegar and honey. Whisk with a fork to combine. Season to taste.\n• Stir the dressing through the cooked couscous. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6671474cbc5e6cd914c30b3d-0d4d056d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pearl couscous between bowls and top with roast veggies and kale.\n• Crumble over goat cheese.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds and parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6671474cbc5e6cd914c30b3d-3d21d5fd.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
